    "uncertainty": {
      "is_genuine": true,
      "crux_parameter": "Net fiscal direction and scale of Universal Credit reform",
      "estimate_range": "Reform could range from net savings (tightening eligibility/rates) to net costs (raising disregards, removing two-child limit etc.); no evidence unit quantifies the funded/unfunded balance of the full package"
